    "description": {
      "value": "You utter a potent litany from your faith, a mandate that harms those who oppose your ideals. You deal 7d10 spirit damage to your enemies in the area; each enemy must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and is enfeebled 2 for 1 minute.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and is enfeebled 2 for 1 minute. On your home plane and the creature is not, the creature is sent back to its home plane. A creature of 10th-level or lower must attempt a Will save or be paralyzed for 1 minute; if it critical fails, it dies."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 1d10, and the level of creatures that must attempt a second save on a critical failure increases by 2."
    },
